// Source hash: md5:e97f18e329235c05345b9449d83fc5fa
// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_num_omega, hol_prod_setprod)
Theorem GCD_ONE : forall a b :e omega, gcd_int a b = 1 -> gcd_int a b = 1.
Admitted.

