// Source hash: md5:d6c02981478c7201187228ea5a76f5a9
// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_num_omega, hol_prod_setprod)
Theorem COPRIME_SYM : forall a b :e omega, gcd_int a b = 1 <-> gcd_int b a = 1.
Admitted.

