// Source hash: md5:9f71071251107832a9dc47350a4a4a5c
// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_num_omega, hol_prod_setprod, mul_nat_mul_SNo)
Theorem COPRIME_BEZOUT : forall a b :e omega, gcd_int a b = 1 <-> exists x y :e omega, minus_nat (a * x) (b * y) = 1 \/ minus_nat (b * x) (a * y) = 1.
Admitted.

